{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro / Chorus]\n[00:13.86] Even when I'm asleep, I feel awake, when you're away\n[00:17.20] Everything with you is such a chase, cut to the chase\n[00:20.64] Almost left my side the other day, it makes me shake\n[00:23.98] Knowin' you were gonna walk away, you can't be replaced\n[00:27.32] Can't tell you how I feel, I can't explain (Explaaaaain)\n[00:29.98] For you I'ma try to get these lyrics out my brain (Braaaaaain)\n[00:33.24] And for you I will fly through the hell, through the flames (Flaaaaaames)\n[00:37.22] Always, Always, Love You Always\n[Verse 1]\n[00:40.40] For your love, workin' all day, fuck a off day\n[00:43.34] You lookin' cute in your Bape fit, baby, you could go ape\n[00:46.80] All of these other girls are Shenenehs, Martin like Payne\n[00:50.32] I am in love with a beautiful lady, she's in my brain\n[00:53.50] Star, you set my heart on fire — 420 blaze\n[00:57.02] Yeah, no cliché, I can’t explain\n[01:00.72] I got your name tatted on my brain, tatted on my mind\n[01:05.56] Teen Titan, got the Starfire by my side\n[01:08.94] Clark Kent — if she kiss me, it make me fly\n[01:12.38] Sad boy — if she leave me, it make me cry\n[01:15.76] Flash boy — if she need me, I’ll be there in no time\n[01:19.66] She’s all right, so I gave it a go, I gave it a turn\n[01:26.46] I gave her my heart, I’m willin’ to learn\n[01:29.60] And it changed my life, I’m tryna get close with the stars tonight\n[Chorus]\n[01:36.10] Even when I'm asleep, I feel awake, when you're away\n[01:39.48] Everything with you is such a chase, cut to the chase\n[01:42.94] Almost left my side the other day, it makes me shake\n[01:46.24] Knowin' you were gonna walk away, you can't be replaced\n[01:49.68] Can't tell you how I feel, I can't explain (Explaaaaain)\n[01:52.26] For you I'ma try to get these lyrics out my brain (Braaaaaain)\n[01:55.54] And for you I will fly through the hell, through the flames (Flaaaaaames)\n[01:59.50] Always, Always, Love You Always\n[Verse 2]\n[02:04.02] Life keeps on goin' while I'm frozen in snow\n[02:10.30] Yeah, I know that she don't want me no more, uh, yeah\n[02:17.26] I was taught to live and let go\n[02:20.70] I was taught to live and let go\n[02:24.14] I gave all that up like let’s go, yeah\n[02:30.98] I'ma catch a vibe, I won’t pray to her 'cause she won’t testify\n[02:36.36] She ain't passin' me 'cause I'm gon' test the lies\n[02:40.36] All that bullshit she set aside, yeah, ayy\n[02:44.20] People askin' me about my sign, yeah, ayy\n[02:47.12] Tellin' me they know about me, alright, yeah, ayy\n[02:50.60] Why’d you have to go and let me fall all night? Yeah, ayy\n[02:53.94] If we wasn’t compatible, alright\n[02:56.14] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yuh\n[Chorus]\n[02:58.38] Even when I'm asleep, I feel awake, when you're away\n[03:01.78] Everything with you is such a chase, cut to the chase\n[03:05.22] Almost left my side the other day, it makes me shake\n[03:08.54] Knowin' you were gonna walk away, you can't be replaced\n[03:11.90] Can't tell you how I feel, I can't explain (Explaaaaain)\n[03:14.54] For you I'ma try to get these lyrics out my brain (Braaaaaain)\n[03:17.82] And for you I will fly through the hell, through the flames (Flaaaaaames)\n[03:23.70] Always, Always, Love You Always","words":[[8.1,13.4,"[Intro"],[13.42,13.44,"/"],[13.48,13.82,"Chorus]"],[13.86,14.04,"Even"],[14.1,14.24,"when"],[14.32,14.4,"I'm"],[14.48,14.76,"asleep,"],[14.9,14.9,"I"],[14.98,15.16,"feel"],[15.24,15.74,"awake,"],[16.08,16.22,"when"],[16.28,16.52,"you're"],[16.62,16.9,"away"],[17.2,17.72,"Everything"],[17.8,17.96,"with"],[18.04,18.14,"you"],[18.24,18.32,"is"],[18.4,18.6,"such"],[18.68,18.68,"a"],[18.8,19.2,"chase,"],[19.48,19.66,"cut"],[19.74,19.8,"to"],[19.88,19.94,"the"],[20.06,20.48,"chase"],[20.64,20.9,"Almost"],[20.98,21.12,"left"],[21.18,21.3,"my"],[21.38,21.7,"side"],[21.74,21.78,"the"],[21.82,22.16,"other"],[22.26,22.54,"day,"],[22.98,23.06,"it"],[23.12,23.34,"makes"],[23.38,23.44